          "excerpt": "Taking young adults on retreats to other countries to be immersed in the work of Christ in other parts of the world.",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "gd1",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "gds1",
                  "text": "Poiema International takes young adults abroad to be immersed in the church of Jesus Christ beyond our borders. Our trip to Gdańsk, Poland unites American and European believers across the Baltic coast for theological reflection, exploration of historic Reformation heritage, and partnership with local sister congregations."
                }
              ]
            }
